msgid ""
"PayPal buttons (e.g. Pay Later, Venmo, SEPA, iDEAL, Mercado Pago, "
"Bancontact, etc.) are shown automatically based on factors such as the "
"buyer’s country and their device type. <br><br>By default, <b>all buttons "
"are enabled.</b> To disable individual payment buttons, use the "
"<b>\"Disable Specific Payment Buttons\"</b> setting available in each page "
"section below.<br><br>For Express Checkout, it will follow the "
"configuration from the Checkout Page.<br>For Mini Cart, this setting will "
"follow the configuration from the Product Page."
msgstr ""
"PayPal buttons (e.g. Pay Later, Venmo, SEPA, iDEAL, Mercado Pago, "
"Bancontact, etc.) are shown automatically based on factors such as the "
"buyer’s country and their device type. <br><br>By default, <b>all buttons "
"are enabled.</b> To disable individual payment buttons, use the "
"<b>\"Disable Specific Payment Buttons\"</b> setting available in each page "
"section below.<br><br>For Express Checkout, it will follow the "
"configuration from the Checkout Page.<br>For Mini Cart, this setting will "
"follow the configuration from the Product Page."

